# Configure Microtik for Ansible deployment
## Clean previois config
### Find cAP via MAC
`sudo mndp -i enp0s25`
### Connect via MAC Telnet
`sudo mactelnet b8:69:f4:00:4a:76 enp0s25`
### Clear all configuration (~30 s)
`/system reset-configuration no-defaults=yes skip-backup=yes`
## Prepare for Ansible
### Connect via MAC and set admin password
`sudo mactelnet b8:69:f4:00:4a:76 enp0s25`
### Set static IP for cAP Ethernet
`/ip address add address=192.168.88.2/24 interface=ether1`
### Enable SSH on cAP Ethernet
`/ip service enable ssh`
### Set admin password
`/user set admin password=your_password`
## Prepare Linux
### Install system tools
`sudo apt install build-essential libssh-dev python3-dev`
### Make directori for Ansible tests
```
mkdir ./ansible-test
cd ./ansible-test
```
### Create isolated env for Ansible
`python3 -m venv venv`
### Activeate isolated env
`source venv/bin/activate`
### Install ansible tools in venv
`pip install ansible ansible-pylibssh paramiko`



